sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Any instance (app-1 / app-2)
    participant R as Redis
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: POST /api/v1/loans {book_id, days}<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token><br/>Idempotency-Key: <uuid>
    A->>R: GET session:<sha256(token)>
    R-->>A: member_id
    A->>P: BEGIN
    A->>P: SELECT * FROM members WHERE id=:m FOR UPDATE
    A->>P: SELECT * FROM loans WHERE member_id=:m AND idempotency_key=:k
    alt key already processed (retry after a crash)
        P-->>A: existing loan
        A->>P: ROLLBACK
        A-->>C: 201 + Idempotent-Replayed: true (same loan)
    else new request
        A->>P: SELECT * FROM books WHERE id=:b FOR UPDATE
        A->>P: checks: available_copies > 0, active loans < limit, no duplicate
        A->>P: INSERT INTO loans (..., idempotency_key)<br/>UPDATE books SET available_copies = available_copies - 1
        A->>P: COMMIT (atomic state change)
        A->>R: INCR report:popular:version (invalidate shared cache)
        A-->>C: 201 Created + X-Instance-ID
    end
    Note over A: Request-scoped objects (DB session, ORM objects)<br/>are discarded - nothing remains in process memory
